&lt;p&gt;As a Forward Deployed Engineer at Auterion, you will build software that runs on real drones. You will take Auterion’s platform into a specific customer program and make it work on their hardware, for their mission, in the field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a software engineering role. You will design, write, integrate and debug C++ and Python code on a Linux-based autonomy stack, working with AuterionOS, our operating system for autonomous vehicles, and Skynode, our flight and mission computer running PX4 and AuterionOS. Your work will span autonomy, computer vision, video streaming and long-range radio links, on partner platforms across aerial, maritime and ground vehicles. What sets this role apart is that your work isn’t finished when the code is merged; it’s finished when the system flies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join a forward deployed team dedicated to a single customer program, which owns the outcome from first requirement to deployed system. You will work directly with partners and customers, as well as with Auterion’s core platform, hardware and flight test teams. Between trips, you will work from our Munich office, both at your desk and on the bench.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No drone experience is required. If you have integrated software on cars, robots, industrial machines or other embedded systems, you already have the right foundation, and we will teach you the drone side.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement software for customer programs on AuterionOS and Skynode, including features, integrations, payload and sensor drivers, and tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring up complete systems on real hardware, including compute, sensors, payloads and radios, and get them working end to end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Debug across the full stack, determining whether an issue stems from software, configuration, hardware or RF, and then resolving it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate customer mission requirements into technical solutions and working demonstrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on site with partners and customers to run flight tests, trials and demonstrations, solving problems directly in the field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploy software releases to customer systems, including flashing, configuration and calibration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report field learnings back to core engineering in a form they can act on, and help shape the product roadmap with real customer input.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document what you build so that future teams can repeat it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Computer Science, Software, Electrical, Robotics or Aerospace Engineering, or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience developing software in modern C++, plus Python for tooling, automation and data analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Linux skills, including the command line, logs, Docker and networking (IP, TCP/UDP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience getting software running on embedded or physical systems, including comfort with UART, CAN, I2C and SPI, wiring, and using a multimeter on the bench&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A structured approach to debugging and the ability to stay methodical under time pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication in English with customers, operators and engineers alike&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eligibility for German security clearance (Sicherheitsüberprüfung)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with PX4 or ArduPilot, MAVLink or QGroundControl&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with video pipelines, computer vision, or radio and datalink systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integration or field engineering experience in automotive, robotics or aerospace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with defense or government customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;German language skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extended social security package&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellpass membership&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Warsaw, Vienna, Berlin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stack:&lt;/strong&gt; Linux, AWS/GCP/Azure, BGP/OSPF, IaC, Datacenter Hardware&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contract:&lt;/strong&gt; B2B, Full-Time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🚀&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Join fiskaly! Help Us Build Trust in Compliance &amp;amp; Security&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every scalable, secure, and efficient product squad relies on a rock-solid infrastructure foundation. We are building resilient network and hardware layers that allow our platforms to operate securely and without avoidable operational disruption. We are looking for a Senior Hybrid Infrastructure Engineer who wants to take ownership of our foundational infrastructure. You will operate at the intersection of physical hardware and cloud environments, bringing reliability, advanced automation, and intelligent design to our core networks and datacenters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;💼&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;As a Senior individual contributor, you will be responsible for the design, operation, and evolution of our organization’s foundational infrastructure layers. You will not just maintain the status quo; you will own the standards for hyperscaler organization structure, network segmentation, and infrastructure automation across all environments. You will hold administrative access to cloud landing zones, network devices, core routing services, and bare-metal hosts. Working across both physical and virtual infrastructure layers, you will meticulously plan live system maintenance, verify operational readiness, and ensure that our core network paths and datacenter connectivity remain highly stable with minimal unplanned downtime.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🛠️&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Hybrid Connectivity Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the design and maintenance of hybrid cloud connectivity, enterprise routing, failover patterns, and datacenter-to-hyperscaler interconnects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Standardize &amp;amp; Automate:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the standards for hyperscaler structures, network segmentation, and infrastructure automation. Maintain accurate infrastructure inventory, topology documentation, and operational runbooks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Datacenter Operations:&lt;/strong&gt; Guide hardware lifecycle planning, rack readiness, cabling standards, and physical deployment quality across datacenters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Reliability &amp;amp; Capacity Planning:&lt;/strong&gt; Review and improve system reliability, capacity planning, and risk management. You will proactively scale and document hybrid infrastructure architecture before bottlenecks emerge.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strategic Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with Platform Engineering, Security, and application teams to expose infrastructure capabilities in a secure, consistent, and sustainable way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Disciplined Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Execute critical infrastructure changes prioritizing safety and operational readiness. Support structured change reviews, maintenance planning, and rigorous change control practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;✨&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Deep Technical Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Advanced expertise in Linux/Unix administration, cloud platforms (AWS, GCP, Azure), and enterprise networking protocols (BGP/OSPF).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Hybrid Infrastructure Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong practical experience with cloud landing zone design, network topology management, hybrid interconnect design, and datacenter hardware operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Automation &amp;amp; AI Literacy:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficient in Infrastructure as Code and configuration automation. You intelligently leverage AI-assisted tooling for network diagnostics and automation while maintaining strict review discipline and awareness of AI-generated risks in privileged tooling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Safety-Conscious Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Highly methodical and detail-oriented. You possess a strong sense of ownership and change discipline for live system maintenance and production network changes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Proven Track Record:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience heavily contributing to production hybrid infrastructure at scale. You have successfully reduced manual effort through standardization and executed low-risk infrastructure projects (such as secure datacenter-to-cloud migrations).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Effective Communication &amp;amp; Mentorship:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to troubleshoot production-grade issues under pressure. You clearly communicate capacity, risk, and downtime planning with stakeholders and naturally mentor peers in infrastructure best practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;💡&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;High-Impact Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Administrative authority over cloud landing zones, network devices, bare-metal hosts, and core routing services to shape the foundation of our platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;A Culture of Engineering Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; An environment that values clean topology modeling, resilient routing, and automation over manual configuration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; A highly collaborative setup working alongside Platform Engineering and product squads to deliver secure, foundational capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strategic Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Opportunities to lead massive infrastructure projects and migrations with high visibility and business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Proactive Over Reactive Environment:&lt;/strong&gt; A focus on scaling architecture and capacity proactively, ensuring the network remains stable without constant firefighting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Flexibility &amp;amp; Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Modern tooling, structured operational readiness checks, and a strong culture of autonomy and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🌍&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Why fiskaly?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re not just building tech,&amp;nbsp; we’re shaping the future of digital compliance. At fiskaly, we believe in trust, shared vision, and celebrating success together. If you want to grow your career where security meets innovation, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join Proton and build a better internet where privacy is the default&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2014 by scientists who met at CERN, Proton was built on the belief that &lt;strong&gt;privacy is a fundamental human right&lt;/strong&gt;. What started as an encrypted email service has grown into an ecosystem of privacy-first products, including Proton Mail, VPN, Drive, Pass, and Calendar, used by millions of people worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re profitable, independent, and building for the long term. Free from venture capital control and advertising-driven business models, we focus on what matters most: our users. Our work helps protect digital freedom, from everyday privacy to supporting journalists and activists in challenging environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, we&#39;re an international team of 700+ people, with offices across 9 countries. We have high standards for the people we hire and the work we do. You&#39;ll work alongside talented, driven colleagues who challenge each other, take ownership, and care about getting things right.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Explore our &lt;a href=&quot;https://proton.me/community/open-source&quot;&gt;open-source projects&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your impact:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re hiring Product Engineers at senior and staff levels.&lt;/strong&gt; If you’ve led complex technical projects and want to keep building hands-on, we’d love to hear from you. Your scope and level will reflect your experience and the impact you can bring.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Product Engineer (Full-Stack), you’ll help shape what we build and own work from understanding the problem through to release and improvement. You’ll speak directly with customers, collaborate with Product and Design, and work across the parts of the stack needed to deliver a complete solution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Understand and shape the problem:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with Product, Design and customers to understand user needs, question assumptions and decide what is worth building.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own complete features:&lt;/strong&gt; Turn problems into practical solutions across clients, services and data. Take work through testing, release and improvement, paying attention to usability, performance and behaviour in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build effectively with agents:&lt;/strong&gt; Define clear tasks, provide context and evaluate generated code. Investigate failures, challenge suggestions and make changes yourself when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improve how software gets built:&lt;/strong&gt; Turn recurring problems into better agent instructions, tests, tools and automated safeguards. Share improvements that help the whole team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build for trust:&lt;/strong&gt; Make privacy, security, reliability and maintainability part of your decisions. Verify important failure cases, communicate what remains uncertain and make sound trade-offs about release readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience delivering production software:&lt;/strong&gt; You can explain the problems you solved, the decisions you made and what you learned from maintaining your work after release.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Frontend and backend experience:&lt;/strong&gt; You’ve built and shipped production features using at least one frontend technology (React, TypeScript or JavaScript) and at least one backend technology (Rust, PHP, Java, Python, Go or Node.js). You may be stronger on one side depending on the team, but you’re comfortable working on both.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practical capability with coding agents:&lt;/strong&gt; You’ve used agents to deliver working software and can explain how you guide them, improve unsuccessful approaches and verify their output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Code fluency and engineering judgement:&lt;/strong&gt; You can navigate unfamiliar code, trace behaviour, diagnose problems and make precise changes. You can assess an implementation regardless of who — or what — wrote it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product judgement:&lt;/strong&gt; You connect technical choices to user needs, care about the quality of the experience and distinguish a useful reduction in scope from a shortcut that puts users at risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership and collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; You move work forward through uncertainty, explain trade-offs clearly, seek out expertise and take responsibility for the outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; You’ve led complex projects through ambiguous requirements, made decisions with lasting consequences and helped other engineers develop their judgement while remaining hands-on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work that Matters:&lt;/strong&gt; Millions of people trust Proton with their privacy. We answer only to our users — not advertisers, not investors with conflicting agendas, not governments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Great Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Diverse, collaborative, and tight-knit, with people from MIT, Harvard, Stanford, Caltech, Cambridge, ETH, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology:&lt;/strong&gt; The right hardware and software to do your best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development:&lt;/strong&gt; We invest in your growth. Proton is one of the fastest ways to accelerate your career — real challenges, real ownership, from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong health coverage, solid retirement options, generous leave, and wellness support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stock Options:&lt;/strong&gt; From day one, you have a real stake in what we&#39;re building. When Proton wins, you win.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In-Person Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Offices across Geneva, Zürich, Barcelona, London, and more. You&#39;ll spend most of your time collaborating face-to-face.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Food:&lt;/strong&gt; Lunch and snacks on us every day in the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transport:&lt;/strong&gt; We cover public transport, bike allowances, or parking — whichever works for you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Working:&lt;/strong&gt; You own your schedule. Outcomes matter more than clock-in times.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation range:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compensation will be discussed during the interview process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;We&#39;re hiring across multiple experience levels for this position. Your level and compensation will be determined based on your skills, experience and performance throughout the interview process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our commitment to diversity and inclusion:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Proton, we believe diversity drives innovation and strengthens our mission to provide privacy as a default for all. We are committed to fostering an inclusive environment where all individuals, regardless of race, ethnicity, gender, age, sexual orientation, physical ability, or socio-economic background, feel valued and empowered. We strive to create equal opportunities, promote open dialogue, and support continuous learning to ensure every voice is heard and respected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any extra support or reasonable adjustments during the hiring process, please let your talent partner know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate privacy notice:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you apply for a position, refer a candidate, or are considered for a role at Proton AG (&quot;Proton,&quot; &quot;we,&quot; &quot;us,&quot; or &quot;our&quot;), we store and process your information using Greenhouse, our recruitment platform. Two privacy policies apply to this information, together:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.greenhouse.com/privacy-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Greenhouse&#39;s Service Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;, which governs how Greenhouse, as our data processor, handles and secures the information within their platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://job-boards.eu.greenhouse.io/protongdpr&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Proton&#39;s Recruitment &amp;amp; Hiring Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;, which governs how we, as the data controller, use, retain, and manage your information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We use your information to evaluate your suitability for the role you&#39;ve applied for. We also retain it to consider you for future roles that may align with your background and skills, unless you ask us not to.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Once we no longer have a legitimate business need to process your information, we will delete or anonymize it. If you have questions about how we use or manage your data, or if you&#39;d like to access, correct, or delete it, contact our privacy team at &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Proton does not accept unsolicited resumes from any source other than directly from candidates, and we will not pay a fee for any placement resulting from an unsolicited submission, even if the candidate is later hired by Proton.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
