&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is leading a new era in cloud infrastructure for the global AI economy. We are building a full-stack AI cloud platform that supports developers and enterprises from data and model training through to production deployment, without the cost and complexity of building large in-house AI/ML infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built by engineers, for engineers. From large-scale GPU orchestration to inference optimization, we own the hard problems across compute, storage, networking and applied AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listed on Nasdaq (NBIS) and headquartered in Amsterdam, we have a global footprint with R&amp;amp;D hubs across Europe, the UK, North America and Israel. Our team of 1,500+ includes hundreds of engineers with deep expertise across hardware, software and AI R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;The-role&quot; data-local-id=&quot;52380826160a&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;32&quot;&gt;The role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;heading-anchor-wrapper css-v48shi&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;42&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e355b01a839d&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Delivery Director to lead customer delivery within the Customer Experience organization at Nebius.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;163&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c25f70413a4c&quot;&gt;Nebius provides cloud infrastructure for companies building and running AI/ML workloads. Your mission is to make customer deployments predictable: agree on realistic plans, keep teams aligned, and ensure customers are ready to go live.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;400&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0e85d18f2df5&quot;&gt;You will lead the pre-sales and delivery &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;TPM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; team and work closely with customers, Sales, Infrastructure, and Engineering. You will manage delivery commitments, address risks and delays, and help resolve difficult customer situations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;Your-responsibilities-will-include:&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0539679eca26&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;636&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;heading-anchor-wrapper css-v48shi&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;69dd54a9-2ef5-431f-8297-07239e2f2358&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;675&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1cd712909f49&quot;&gt;Coordinate customer delivery from contract signing to go-live, working with Infrastructure and Engineering on technical readiness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;809&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f46905457cc1&quot;&gt;Agree on timelines, delivery scope, and launch success criteria with customers and Sales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;902&quot; data-local-id=&quot;05f8437ef736&quot;&gt;Lead the pre-sales and delivery &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;TPM&lt;/span&gt; team: set priorities, assign ownership, hire and develop people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1006&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e31e786d588b&quot;&gt;Align launch plans with Infrastructure and Engineering based on capacity and readiness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1097&quot; data-local-id=&quot;336aa11f6aa8&quot;&gt;Manage delivery risks and delays, including their impact on contracts, billing, and customer commitments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1206&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0ae4071fe9ca&quot;&gt;Handle escalations and difficult discussions&amp;nbsp;together with Sales and other leaders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1293&quot; data-local-id=&quot;77a4a2ef86ad&quot;&gt;Ensure regular customer updates and a clear handover of commitments to post-sales teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1385&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9e6eb697c8d7&quot;&gt;Creation of deployment process documentation for customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1448&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f9535aa8d1e6&quot;&gt;Report on deliveries to &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;GTM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; leadership, agree on priorities, and act on feedback.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;We-expect-you-to-have:&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b1580f24e5d8&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1533&quot;&gt;We expect you to have:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;heading-anchor-wrapper css-v48shi&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0f71cb71-508b-49ae-bad8-adae676e591b&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1559&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3b0ed14f97e7&quot;&gt;Experience leading customer delivery in cloud, infrastructure, or other technical environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1658&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3c33a2a15beb&quot;&gt;Experience working directly with senior customer stakeholders, managing expectations, delays, and escalations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1772&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d81fea09ced6&quot;&gt;Experience leading TPMs or project managers, including hiring and team development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1859&quot; data-local-id=&quot;236cac90aa2f&quot;&gt;Experience managing multiple deployments with shared resources and dependencies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1943&quot; data-local-id=&quot;01b26de3b8ac&quot;&gt;Understanding of cloud infrastructure, including compute, storage, networking, and readiness for customer go-live.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
